# Example demo full-bleed layout (locked)

**Bug pattern:** 代码示例 / curated demo 在 `.ln-content` 里看起来「没铺满」——中间一窄条、右侧大片留白，或代码区被 `max-height` 压成小滚动盒。

## Hard rule

`DemoBlock` · `DemoCode` · `PropsTable` · curated root (`.vp-curated`) **must span the full content column** (minus shell `--theme-page-pad` only).

| Do | Don't |
|----|--------|
| `width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box` on demo chrome | `max-width: 24–48rem` on DemoBlock / curated / code / API tables |
| Let code grow with content; page scrolls in `.ln-content` | Nested `max-height` on `.vp-demo-code` that creates a second scrollbar |
| Wrap chip/button rows in an inner flex row (`width: 100%` host, shrink-wrap children) | Rely on DemoBlock preview alone without a full-width root wrapper when the demo is a stack/block |
| Prose-only `max-width` on lead/hint paragraphs if needed | Apply reading-column `max-width` to the whole doc section that contains demos |

## Shared pieces

- `example/components/demo/DemoBlock.vue` — host stretches; single slot child stretches
- `example/components/demo/DemoCode.vue` — full width; **no** height cap
- `example/components/demo/curatedDemo.scss` — `.vp-curated { width: 100% … }`
- `example/pages/base/ComponentDocPage.vue` — page/section `width: 100%`; prose classes only on text

## When adding / editing curated demos

1. Root: `.vp-curated` (import `curatedDemo.scss` or copy the width contract).
2. Inside `DemoBlock`, prefer **one** root wrapper for stacks/forms (`width: 100%`); multi-button rows = flex wrap row with `width: 100%`.
3. Never put `max-width` on the curated host unless the demo **intentionally** shows a narrow control (document why in a one-line comment).
4. Motion / live panels: `width: 100%`; center content *inside* a full-width preview band if needed — don't shrink the band.

## Shell

`.ln-content` padding is the only intentional inset (`--theme-page-pad`). Do not add a second content `max-width` wrapper around RouterView children for base component docs.

Docs: `docs/APP_WORKFLOW.md` (demo layout) · `example/README.md`.
